                <pb facs="0709" n="605" xml:id="pg605"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>According to the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg470">p.
                        470</ref>, this dinner meeting lasted until 10:30 p.m. No official minutes
                    of the conversation appear to have been prepared, but a memorandum prepared by
                        Bohlen a few days later (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg838">p. 838</ref>) indicates
                    that the Declaration on Iran and the Conference communiqué were discussed and
                    put into final form.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
